&lt;p&gt;At MongoDB, our Account Development team works closely with our partners in both Sales and Marketing to build fanatical customer enthusiasm around MongoDB. SDR reps are responsible for identifying and qualifying new opportunities for our sales organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We view our Account Development program as the best way to turbocharge a long and successful career in sales and view our Sales Development Representatives (SDRs) as the next wave of Account Executives at MongoDB.&lt;/p&gt;
