&lt;li&gt;Be curious and creative when considering sales cycle and quote-to-cash timelines, with a view to improving these processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace a continuous improvement mindset, focusing on processes and technology to enhance productivity and efficiency, and deploying Ai solutions at scale&lt;/li&gt;
