&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a US Person on US soil (i.e. U.S. citizen, U.S. national, lawful permanent resident, asylee, or refugee living and working in the United States)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to participate in pager duty rotations during nights, weekends and holidays (approximately one out of every six weeks), at least during an initial ramping period (and potentially permanently)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
