&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a high-energy, driven leader with a passion for excellence to serve as the Regional Vice President, Enterprise, Growth, for India. In this &quot;leader of leaders&quot; role, you will manage a highly talented team of Regional Directors. Your primary focus will be formulating and executing a growth strategy within India, resulting in aggressive revenue growth within our existing strategic enterprise customers,and world-class recruitment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
