&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is looking for a transformational HR Leader who has partnered with senior leaders to drive complex, global change at scale. As the Senior Director, you will partner with the Chief Revenue Officer Leadership Team and the VP, HRBP to drive a people strategy that enables durable, profitable growth, expands our market reach, and builds a deep bench of leaders for tomorrow. The role reports to the VP, HR Business Partnering and manages a global team of two.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At MongoDB, the HRBP team’s key focus is to be a trusted advisor to business leaders, translating business strategy into people and organizational priorities that drive performance, culture and growth. This includes shaping workforce strategy &amp;amp; culture, optimizing organizational design and building leadership capability. They use data and insights to influence decisions, anticipate talent needs and ensure that the business has the right structure, culture and capabilities to scale. In short, they are an extension of the business leadership team. They accomplish all of this through very close collaboration with the various other functions within the People Team - Total Rewards, Culture Talent &amp;amp; Development, Talent Acquisition, Regional HR, HR Operations, and People&amp;nbsp;Analytics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in the United States for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;​Strategic Partnership &amp;amp; Business Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to the CRO and global Sales leadership team, shaping people and organizational strategies that drive scalable revenue growth and global market expansion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage business acumen and data-driven insights to influence decisions on organization design, talent strategy, and leadership effectiveness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop a global team, fostering growth, excellence, and deep partnership capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Talent &amp;amp; Performance Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a high-performance culture through disciplined goal-setting, continuous feedback, and performance calibration across regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with leaders to identify, develop, and retain top talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use analytics and insights to diagnose trends, assess bench strength, and implement targeted development and engagement strategies that sustain performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practice what you coach within your own team, providing continuous feedback, coaching and guidance to your team of BPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership Development &amp;amp; Succession Planning&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead succession planning for critical roles, ensuring depth and readiness across the global Sales organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide executive coaching and counsel to senior leaders to elevate influence, decision-making, and people leadership capability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Organizational Planning, Design &amp;amp; Change Leadership&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global transformation and organizational design initiatives to ensure that the organizational structure enables accountability, scalability and performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect organizational change, ensuring transformations are executed thoughtfully and sustainably with clear communication and employee engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Employee Experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a culture carrier and change agent, embedding company values and leadership principles into daily decisions, programs &amp;amp; behaviors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of retention where teams feel empowered and aligned to outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Profile &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12+ years of HR experience, including 8+ years in senior HRBP roles and at least 4+ years leading a team of HRBPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading people strategy and organizational transformation in a high-growth, high-performance technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen and deep understanding of Go-To-Market operations and strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to influence, build trust, and drive change across complex global organizations with very senior leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leading through ambiguity and scaling organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytical and insight-driven; uses data to guide decisions and measure impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional communication, judgment, and credibility at the most senior levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumption experience is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is built for change, empowering our customers and our people to innovate at the speed of the market. We have redefined the data platform for the AI era, enabling builders to create, transform, and disrupt industries with software. MongoDB’s unified data platform, the most widely available, globally distributed data platform on the market, helps organizations modernize legacy workloads, embrace innovation, and unleash AI. Our cloud-native platform, MongoDB Atlas, is the only globally distributed, multi-cloud data platform and is available across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
