&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is seeking a Senior Executive Assistant to support two Vice Presidents, in Field Operations. This position is ideal for a dynamic, intelligent, highly organized individual who takes ownership of the details and loves to get things done. In this role, your day will consist of managing and prioritizing a steady stream of requests, meetings, and travel, while working closely with your executives and other members of their teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To succeed, you’ll need to thoughtfully and diplomatically balance the needs of multiple stakeholders and be ready to pitch in wherever needed. This role may also provide temporary support during coverage gaps, so flexibility and a team-first mindset are important. You should feel comfortable interacting with senior leaders and know how and when to manage in any direction across the organization, regardless of role, title, or level. You can navigate Google Workspace products, or comparable tools, and have the ability to quickly learn the systems needed to execute tasks effectively. You have strong written and verbal communication skills and enjoy using them. We have a collaborative, team-based culture, and the successful candidate will enjoy building relationships and teamwork just as much as the challenges of the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Palo Alto, San Francisco, or Los Angeles for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
