&lt;p&gt;Senior Forward Deployed Engineers (FDE) sit at the intersection of enterprise customer environments and a fast-moving internal product. They partner directly with customers to design, build, troubleshoot, and improve production solutions, and they are ultimately accountable for helping customers get to production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is best suited for engineers who want to own technical outcomes end to end: understanding what a customer is trying to build, shipping the integration, and feeding learnings back into the product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Gurugram for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Customer success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical owner for customer engagements from initial discovery through production rollout&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand each customer&#39;s architecture, constraints, and definition of success, and drive toward that outcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage expectations, communicate risks clearly, and help customers navigate technical decisions with confidence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Technical integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the connectors, pipelines, and supporting tooling needed to make the platform work inside real enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write production-quality code, troubleshoot issues, and implement fixes directly in active workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work effectively within customer environments that have different stacks, infrastructure, and integration constraints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Product feedback loop&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture product feedback with precision, including logs, reproduction steps, and a clear proposed path forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer engagements to identify product gaps, surface recurring patterns, and help improve the product roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document technical decisions and tradeoffs clearly so product and engineering teams can extend the work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Workstream collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product and engineering teams to help turn field patterns into reusable product capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute directly in focused workstreams by helping drive technical design, implementation, and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound engineering decisions under pressure while building and iterating quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Engagement management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate independently across internal teams and customer stakeholders to keep delivery moving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly across technical, business, and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 - 8 years of engineering experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on production engineering experience, including writing code, debugging failures, and implementing fixes directly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering experience in AI and agentic development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with developing and deploying software within enterprise environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience shipping production solutions at scale that customers relied on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building integrations across existing systems and infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting and code review skills, including the ability to identify root causes and drive resolution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel up to 30% to customer sites as needed for on-site engagements, technical reviews, and presentations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with LLMs, agent frameworks, or deploying AI systems in production&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in an FDE or similar forward-deployed engineering role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
