&lt;li&gt;Partner with Technical Support, Customer Success, and Professional Services to align technology investments with operational goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure integration with Sales, Customer Success, Billing, and Product systems through standardized APIs and data models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain high availability, security, and compliance across all support platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/h3&gt;
