&lt;li&gt;Case summarization and sentiment detection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Next-best-action recommendations and predictive case routing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomous AI agents and copilots embedded in support workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
