&lt;li&gt;Establish frameworks to measure AI containment rates, hallucination risk, escalation patterns, and customer trust&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the transition from reactive case management to predictive, proactive support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance for responsible, secure, and explainable AI deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform support data into a strategic asset that informs Product and business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
