&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive governance and prioritization across a high-volume requirements backlog, managing stakeholder expectations, resource constraints, and phased delivery commitments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead by influence across cross-functional teams including Sales AEs, SAs, CSMs, Partner Ops, and engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upskill support agents and managers in AI collaboration; partner with HR and Enablement to redefine roles in an AI-native organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
