&lt;li&gt;Experience owning and driving build-vs-buy decisions with business and finance stakeholders to conclusion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive communication skills; able to present defensible technology recommendations to CIO and CCO-level leadership&lt;/li&gt;
