&lt;p&gt;The Data Engineering team is responsible for building ETL pipelines that populate the Internal Data Platform, which drives analytics that help the company run more efficiently. Our team builds highly performant and scalable processes that extract massive datasets and makes those datasets available for querying in an optimal way.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking to speak to candidates who are based in Gurgaon for our hybrid working model.&lt;/p&gt;
